# ─── GeoGuess Configuration ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ① Google Maps (OPTIONAL — enables real Street View panoramas)
#    Get a key at https://console.cloud.google.com/
#    Enable: Maps JavaScript API + Street View Static API
#    Without this key the game runs with curated photo locations (works great!)
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# ② Supabase (OPTIONAL — enables live online multiplayer rooms)
#    Create a free project at https://supabase.com
#    Without these, the game runs in Solo/Challenge mode (shareable links still work)
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

# ─── Notes ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# • The game works immediately with NO env vars configured.
# • Add GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY to use real Street View instead of curated photos.
# • Add Supabase keys to enable "Create Room / Join Room" live multiplayer.
# • Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the values you want.
